WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.500
<v Priya Sharma>Okay everyone, let's get started with sprint 42 planning.</v>

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
<v Rahul Verma>Quick update: the checkout timeout bug is still hitting about two percent of orders.</v>

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Priya Sharma>That's a blocker for the release. Rahul, can you fix the checkout timeout bug by tomorrow?</v>

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.000
<v Rahul Verma>Yes, on it.</v>

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Anita Desai>On the API side, I'll send the updated API contract to the mobile team by Friday.</v>

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Priya Sharma>Great. On payments, we've decided to go with Razorpay for the India launch.</v>

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:46.000
<v Rahul Verma>Could you share the Razorpay sandbox credentials</v>

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.000
<v Rahul Verma>with me?</v>

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.000
<v Anita Desai>Sure.</v>

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:58.000
<v Priya Sharma>I'll set up the staging environment by Wednesday. We need to update the release checklist before launch.</v>

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:05.000
<v Anita Desai>No rush, but Rahul, could you review my pagination PR when you get a chance?</v>

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:12.000
<v Priya Sharma>To recap, Rahul will fix the checkout timeout bug and Anita will send the API contract. Thanks all.</v>
